@startuml clean_runtime
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Clean game / learning boundaries
component "packages/game-core\ncanonical init + B/C/F physics\nactual-mutation causal sink" as GAME <<app>>
component "Rollout + evaluation harness\nnot implemented" as RUN <<app>>
component "crates/learning\nBurn model + episodic objective" as ML <<app>>
component "packages/contracts\nZod recipient observation + JSON Schema" as CONTRACT <<app>>
component "crates/policy-io\nstandard JSON / Serde scoring" as IO <<app>>
component "packages/policy\nbounded candidates + versioned encoder" as POLICY <<app>>
database "Burn native model records\nsynthetic round-trip test" as STORE <<db>>
component "Product applications\nmigration pending" as UI <<app>>
node "Cargo + Bun\nstandard development tools" as TOOLS <<host>>
node "Host mise\npreflight / planned seeding + provisioning" as HOST <<host>>
node "Dedicated admitted sbx\nseparate execution grant" as SBX <<host>>
HOST ..> SBX : supported CLI contract pending
SBX ..> RUN : separately authorized job
UI ..> GAME : game API
RUN ..> GAME : observations / legal actions / replay
RUN ..> POLICY : recipient observation / candidates
POLICY --> CONTRACT : standard validation
POLICY --> IO : 2271 numeric coordinates / candidate
IO --> ML : frozen model / bounded feature batch
RUN ..> CONTRACT : recipient-local data; producer pending
ML --> STORE : Burn record API
TOOLS --> ML : build / synthetic tests
TOOLS --> GAME : Bun regression tests
TOOLS --> CONTRACT : strict static + invariant tests
TOOLS --> IO : native / cross-language e2e
note bottom of RUN
  Proposed boundaries grant no runtime authority.
  Host verification and training remain separate.
end note
@enduml
